<view class="page">
    <view class="custom-nav" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px; height: {{navBarHeight}}px;">
        <view class="nav-title">首页</view>
    </view>

    <view class="poster-wrap">
        <image
            class="poster"
            src="../../images/home/home.png"
            mode="widthFix"
            lazy-load="true"
            show-menu-by-longpress="true"
        />

        <view class="brand">
            <image class="brand-log" src="../../images/home/log.png" mode="widthFix" />
        </view>

        <view class="content-mask"></view>

        <view class="content-wrap">
            <image class="slogan-image" src="../../images/home/wenzi.png" mode="widthFix" />
            <view class="desc">
                得正是（正莲）对做事的态度，精进是（正莲）对品质的追求，心如莲花是（正莲）对理想的人格追求，复杂多变的社会中保持心灵的纯洁和高尚，通过不断的自我修炼，实现传承的宁静与自由。
            </view>
        </view>
    </view>
</view>